{"id": "EUVD-2026-60104", "enisaUuid": "b38f02c3-ac1e-3f9f-b3d9-989ebc749594", "description": "openssl_encrypt versions before 1.4.0 contain a logging bug in restore_hidden_modules() that logs module counts after clearing, always showing zero restored modules and corrupting audit trails. Additionally, a race condition exists between module hiding and import hook installation where another thread could re-import blocked modules in multi-threaded environments.", "datePublished": "2026-08-17T11:04:50", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-01T15:20:57", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/jahlives/openssl_encrypt/security/advisories/GHSA-43r4-3hf9-m84q", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openssl-encrypt-before-logging-bug-and-race-condition"], "aliases": ["PYSEC-2026-3762", "CVE-2026-74885", "GHSA-9j5f-pjwj-62r3"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "19e11607-89ef-38a4-830c-4f06bc498ed3", "product": {"name": "openssl_encrypt", "vendor": {"name": "jahlives"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.4.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "2d2f1679-92ce-3762-a080-1a8f86ef3765", "vendor": {"name": "jahlives"}}], "isExploited": false}